{"reviewId": "73185342_88EOrVmGk", "review": {"abstract": "在康波的萧条、回升及衰退阶段，黄金价格与实际利率的负相关真实存在，但在繁荣期，这种关系基本上不存在，甚至相反，这实际上是康波中不同阶段大宗商品的表现不同所致。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "现在是黄金暴涨，因为世界局势动荡，都是战争，这个可以理解。经济下行，消费不振，这个也可以理解。因为战争，原油，有色金属，化学产品等都暴涨，这个也可以理解。人工智能，互联网也暴涨……我就想问现在是什么阶段？应该萧条，但是没萧条，繁荣吧，世界局势还动荡，这是不是特拧巴？", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "25353-25432", "createTime": 1777211990, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "73185342_88EOrVmGk", "userVid": 73185342, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 73185342, "name": "苗鑫", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0010-2uSEqhJ4tOjVFBB2p~3yme5/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "苗鑫", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "本人有牛皮癣也就是银屑病", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "之所以写出来是想告诉你，无论怎样，请你好好活着，努力活着。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-E-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 1, "likes": [{"userVid": 395297078, "name": "番茄🍅flowers", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/5mxuSU5RGharba7yH8kVR4VicWObwJKnvorxRXuVKWeaCCZrU9E6jDDbPnHRiartACjEQibstwSLaM/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "